---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CaptureBlock from '../components/CaptureBlock.astro';
---
<Base title="Start Here — Cassian Creed" description="New to Cassian Creed? Start with three sourced, victim-first case files — then follow the thread into the explainers behind them.">
  <section class="sh">
    <p class="evidence evidence--accent">Start Here</p>
    <h1>New here? Start with these.</h1>
    <p class="sh__lede">Three case files are the best way in — each sourced from the public record, each told victim-first. Read one, then follow the thread into the explainers behind it.</p>

    <div class="sh__grid">
      <a class="door" href="/post/the-murder-of-rachel-morin-how-her-killer-was-found/">
        <div>
          <span class="door__no">Nº 01</span>
          <h2 class="door__title">The Murder of Rachel Morin</h2>
          <p class="door__desc">How investigative genetic genealogy found a killer who sat in no DNA database — convicted, with an appeal now pending.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="door__go">Read the case →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="door" href="/post/what-happened-in-the-idaho-student-murders-the-bryan-kohberger-case-explained/">
        <div>
          <span class="door__no">Nº 02</span>
          <h2 class="door__title">The Idaho Student Murders</h2>
          <p class="door__desc">The Bryan Kohberger case, explained — four students, the knife-sheath DNA that broke it, and the 2025 guilty plea.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="door__go">Read the case →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="door" href="/post/the-murdaugh-murders-how-alex-murdaugh-was-convicted-and-why-he-now-faces-a-new-trial/">
        <div>
          <span class="door__no">Nº 03</span>
          <h2 class="door__title">The Murdaugh Murders</h2>
          <p class="door__desc">A conviction — and why South Carolina's most-watched case now faces a new trial.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="door__go">Read the case →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="sh__next">
      <p>Then go deeper: <a href="/post/what-is-coercive-control-the-signs-examples-and-what-to-do/">What Is Coercive Control?</a> — the warning sign behind so many of these cases, and what to do about it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CONVERSION-FIRST RANK 1 (2026-07-28): the "The Trail — $1.99" promo
      section stood here — heading, cover thumbnail linking to /the-trail/,
      bundle line and buy button. Removed while the title is held for
      worthiness review; recoverable from git history. Nothing was put in its
      place, so the page runs straight from the "go deeper" step into the free
      guide capture below. */}

  <section class="subscribe wrap" id="free-guide">
    <CaptureBlock offer="case" content="start_here" />
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .books-promo{padding:56px 0 48px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .books-promo__heading{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:26px;margin:8px 0 28px}
  .books-promo__shelf{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
  .books-promo__item img{display:block;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.55);transition:transform .15s}
  .books-promo__item:hover img{transform:translateY(-3px)}
  .books-promo__bundle{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 20px}
</style>
